By applying   a change of variables of $x = u \odot v$ and $\eta = u \odot u/2$ to \eqref{eq:gibbs}, we obtain  the following probability distribution \begin{align}
\pi(u,v)=\frac{1}{Z_\pi} \prod_{i=1}^d  u_i\, \exp\pp{-\beta\, \pp{\frac12\lambda \|(u,v)\|^2+G(u\odot v)} },\label{pi}
\end{align}
